WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:09.175
[theme music]

00:35.535 --> 00:37.954
RECRUITING SERVANTS FOR SONGRIM

00:38.038 --> 00:39.497
That isn't a letter though.

00:40.373 --> 00:41.750
What is a letter?

00:41.833 --> 00:44.836
As long as it reveals your heart,
then it's a letter.

00:45.545 --> 00:47.839
[pensive music playing]

00:48.465 --> 00:49.716
[sighs]

00:49.799 --> 00:52.051
You must have felt sorry for me

00:52.844 --> 00:54.387
taking that exam.

00:55.430 --> 00:58.349
You were once an incredibly
powerful mage so…

00:58.433 --> 01:00.185
of course, I did feel sorry for you.

01:01.186 --> 01:03.605
I suppose I thought you something
about loyalty.

01:03.688 --> 01:05.857
Seeing how far my master would go,

01:05.940 --> 01:09.194
I did think that I should be doing
my very best as your pupil.

01:11.446 --> 01:12.864
You must have felt pressured.

01:12.947 --> 01:15.658
No, I didn't really, for I was conflicted.

01:16.493 --> 01:19.120
If I should answer this letter
as your young master

01:19.204 --> 01:21.331
or if I should answer as your pupil.

01:21.873 --> 01:24.542
Or just answer based on what I read.

01:25.752 --> 01:27.045
Well, what did you read?

01:28.129 --> 01:31.966
Should I answer
based on that, you think, also?

01:33.468 --> 01:35.011
Also? What?

01:36.054 --> 01:37.263
It's written right here.

01:37.347 --> 01:39.766
"This is how far I will go
just to able to see you."

01:40.391 --> 01:43.645
"I'll do absolutely anything
if I can just see you."

01:44.312 --> 01:45.647
And this is my answer to that.

01:49.150 --> 01:52.987
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

01:57.117 --> 01:58.576
I missed you too. A lot.

02:02.455 --> 02:03.790
That's my response.

02:06.000 --> 02:08.294
["Breath" continues playing]

02:28.106 --> 02:29.232
[deep inhale]

02:33.403 --> 02:34.904
Pretend you didn't read it.

02:35.864 --> 02:37.282
I'll pretend I never sent it.

02:42.453 --> 02:43.913
Does something like that…

02:44.789 --> 02:46.332
just disappear when it's burned?

02:49.002 --> 02:50.336
It's disappearing now.

02:53.047 --> 02:54.632
Once it's all burned to ash,

02:55.967 --> 02:57.635
there will be nothing left to see.

02:59.053 --> 03:01.222
You burned it so there's nothing to see?

03:02.140 --> 03:03.391
But Master…

03:04.142 --> 03:05.476
Your pupil has managed

03:06.227 --> 03:08.771
to read things that cannot be seen.

03:11.065 --> 03:14.485
I told you I read Words of the Heart.
Want to see how?

03:16.571 --> 03:19.115
When reading something that can't be seen,

03:19.866 --> 03:21.326
you really just have to focus.

03:22.702 --> 03:23.828
And then…

03:27.206 --> 03:29.334
you say the name of the recipient.

03:31.878 --> 03:33.004
Mu-deok.

03:34.714 --> 03:36.674
[Mu-deok]
This is a clear and dangerous sign

03:37.425 --> 03:40.303
that I am in love with this man.

03:43.598 --> 03:44.724
I read it.

03:46.517 --> 03:48.853
Just because it cannot be seen

03:48.937 --> 03:50.063
doesn't mean it's not there.

03:50.813 --> 03:51.814
[sighs]

03:55.318 --> 03:57.862
Just like when you caught the blue mark
in my eyes back then,

03:59.822 --> 04:01.366
you've caught me again.

04:03.243 --> 04:05.161
Once again, you found my weakness.

04:05.245 --> 04:07.121
If you insist on calling that a weakness,

04:07.997 --> 04:09.332
then you've seen mine too.

04:11.376 --> 04:13.711
I have yours, you have mine,

04:13.795 --> 04:15.463
so let's just call it even, okay?

04:16.881 --> 04:18.216
You're offering your weakness?

04:19.008 --> 04:20.260
Well, thank you, I guess.

04:22.762 --> 04:25.181
In truth, I felt uneasy
while we were apart.

04:25.848 --> 04:27.892
After all, you'd achieved what you wanted,

04:28.518 --> 04:30.186
and even if you betrayed me now,

04:30.270 --> 04:32.689
I know I wouldn't be able
to do anything about it.

04:33.356 --> 04:36.943
I regretted it, wondering
if I should have poisoned you

04:37.026 --> 04:39.112
or blackmailed you, but…

04:39.195 --> 04:41.322
[scoffs]
Jang Uk,

04:42.740 --> 04:45.285
it seems that you've already taken
the poison.

04:45.368 --> 04:46.786
[brooding music playing]

04:46.869 --> 04:47.996
Poison?

04:48.079 --> 04:50.206
A terrible poison
that weakens and pains you,

04:50.707 --> 04:53.251
but you can't be free of it
because the antidote

04:54.210 --> 04:56.337
is the person who poisons you.

04:56.421 --> 04:59.007
So, the way that I felt missing you

04:59.882 --> 05:01.551
was just a symptom of the poison?

05:02.427 --> 05:03.553
Yes.

05:04.178 --> 05:06.639
You've been struck by the poison
of an assassin.

05:07.265 --> 05:08.599
Just think of it that way.

05:09.726 --> 05:11.352
It's not far from the truth.

05:12.687 --> 05:14.147
So I've been poisoned.

05:15.648 --> 05:18.443
Well, it did seem strange…

05:19.819 --> 05:20.862
that I miss you.

05:21.946 --> 05:24.282
You threaten to kill me
at the drop of a hat.

05:24.365 --> 05:26.159
You even threw an actual knife at me.

05:26.242 --> 05:28.619
You called me incompetent
and trained me ruthlessly.

05:28.703 --> 05:30.413
And you still have the audacity
to lie to me.

05:30.997 --> 05:32.749
None of these things
are the things that I should miss,

05:32.832 --> 05:35.001
but like a madman,
I can't stop thinking about them.

05:35.084 --> 05:36.961
I miss you when I open my eyes.

05:37.045 --> 05:38.546
I miss you every second they're open.

05:38.629 --> 05:40.673
I miss you when they're closed
and I see you in my mind.

05:40.757 --> 05:42.008
- Stop that.
- Why?

05:42.091 --> 05:44.469
If you've spoiled my innocent confessions
with poison

05:44.552 --> 05:47.430
then you should at least
have to hear about my symptoms.

05:47.513 --> 05:49.015
I thought you were the antidote.

05:50.349 --> 05:51.809
All I said was that I missed you

05:51.893 --> 05:54.395
in my child-like innocence and naivety,
you cruel assassin.

05:55.063 --> 05:56.564
And you called it poison.

05:56.647 --> 05:59.192
From now on, I'll complain constantly
of my symptoms

05:59.275 --> 06:00.568
because I have been poisoned.

06:00.651 --> 06:03.029
So I have nothing to be ashamed of.

06:03.112 --> 06:05.907
And since you said you're the antidote,
I'll just keep laying it on you.

06:09.327 --> 06:11.245
[shaky breathing]

06:18.753 --> 06:22.256
This young man is the nephew
of Songrim's leader,

06:22.340 --> 06:25.551
and one day, he'll be the leader himself.

06:30.223 --> 06:33.726
I've come in the leader's place
to offer a few words.

06:34.519 --> 06:36.604
You are part of the Songrim family now.

06:37.688 --> 06:38.689
Welcome.

06:40.983 --> 06:44.362
You've all worked hard
to get through the test.

06:44.904 --> 06:48.991
So tonight, we prepared a feast
with meat and drinks.

06:49.492 --> 06:50.868
So relax and enjoy.

06:50.952 --> 06:52.495
- [woman] Yes.
- [men cheer]

06:52.578 --> 06:54.705
Yeah. Go and get yourselves a drink.

06:54.789 --> 06:55.998
[servants laugh]

06:56.082 --> 06:57.959
- [man 1] Follow me. This way.
- [man 2 laughs]

06:58.042 --> 06:59.252
[man 3 chuckles] Let's go.

07:00.461 --> 07:01.337
Young master.

07:02.171 --> 07:04.340
You know the girl, Mu-deok,

07:04.423 --> 07:06.259
the one who just passed the test today?

07:07.343 --> 07:10.263
Uh, I mean, the girl
who ended up coming in last.

07:12.056 --> 07:15.017
ONE HUNDRED TWENTY-FIVE

07:15.101 --> 07:17.520
SONGRIM SERVANT CONTEST

07:17.603 --> 07:20.314
[crowd cheering, whooping]

07:20.898 --> 07:22.900
[screaming]

07:24.193 --> 07:26.195
[epic music playing]

07:26.279 --> 07:28.322
[crowd cheering]

07:30.908 --> 07:32.785
Number 125, Mu-deok.

07:32.869 --> 07:34.495
[pants]

07:35.204 --> 07:36.539
You passed.

07:36.622 --> 07:38.207
[relieved sigh]

07:45.465 --> 07:47.550
Mu-deok. Yeah, very well.

07:48.634 --> 07:51.345
She collapsed and was taken to Sejukwon.

07:51.429 --> 07:53.890
I need to give this bag back to her.

07:55.391 --> 07:58.853
And the entrance plaque she left with us
during the test.

07:59.437 --> 08:01.522
But do you know
if she's still in Sejukwon perhaps?

08:01.606 --> 08:05.318
- Oh. I can pass them on to her.
- Ah.

08:05.401 --> 08:06.819
Excellent work today.

08:08.404 --> 08:09.614
[maidservant Park] Hmm.

08:12.617 --> 08:14.202
All right. Let's go.

08:20.583 --> 08:23.002
[mysterious stinger playing]

08:30.009 --> 08:31.511
[grunts]

08:32.345 --> 08:33.554
[groans]

08:35.097 --> 08:36.516
[Jang Uk pants]

08:38.643 --> 08:39.894
Oh. Mu-deok.

08:40.895 --> 08:42.813
[pensive music playing]

08:42.897 --> 08:45.441
[panting]

08:51.489 --> 08:52.990
[grunts]

09:00.414 --> 09:03.960
[Mu-deok] The reason you get lost when
you're having too many thoughts is that

09:04.043 --> 09:06.462
you're thinking too many things
all at once.

09:07.630 --> 09:10.174
When that happens, focus on one thing.

09:11.801 --> 09:15.680
[Seo Yul] Naksu. So the one thing
you were focused on is Jang Uk.

09:17.306 --> 09:19.267
[breathes deeply]

09:22.019 --> 09:23.187
[Dang-gu] Hmm.

09:31.153 --> 09:32.238
Hey there, Yul.

09:33.030 --> 09:35.825
I just happened to look
at Mu-deok's belongings,

09:37.326 --> 09:40.204
and there's… something strange.

09:42.039 --> 09:44.750
[Dang-gu] This is the whistle
you carried around, right?

09:45.668 --> 09:47.128
The one you left in Danhyanggok.

09:48.337 --> 09:50.381
[sighs]
Yeah, you're right. It's mine.

09:51.173 --> 09:53.551
But then, why does Mu-deok
have it with her?

09:54.343 --> 09:56.345
[pensive music playing]

10:06.188 --> 10:08.065
Have you seen Young Master Dang-gu?

10:08.691 --> 10:11.235
Apparently, he has my bag
and my Spirit Plaque with him.

10:15.740 --> 10:17.325
He had given them to me earlier.

10:17.908 --> 10:18.743
Ah.

10:19.368 --> 10:20.703
May I?

10:29.920 --> 10:33.799
Did you find this
where I left it back in Danhyanggok?

10:36.010 --> 10:38.054
Uh… yes.

10:38.554 --> 10:41.474
I… I did that because…

10:44.727 --> 10:46.854
Because you're in love with me?

10:46.937 --> 10:49.190
[soft music playing]

10:49.857 --> 10:51.400
You said you loved me.

10:53.277 --> 10:55.488
So I guess I see why you'd do that.

11:01.869 --> 11:03.496
Just give me my things.

11:04.121 --> 11:05.539
You can keep the whistle.

11:10.211 --> 11:13.214
I told Dang-gu
that I actually had given it to you.

11:14.548 --> 11:15.966
It'd be odd to take it back.

11:18.594 --> 11:20.262
Why are you giving it to me?

11:20.346 --> 11:22.348
It's not like you really believe
that I'm in love with you.

11:24.517 --> 11:26.435
Then why don't you make me believe it?

11:34.193 --> 11:38.322
[sighs] You know, up until just now,
I was only teasing them.

11:38.906 --> 11:41.617
But Mu-deok really does have feelings
for Yul.

11:42.201 --> 11:44.203
And seeing how Yul gave that to Mu-deok,

11:44.286 --> 11:46.789
he must not be so indifferent
to her either, huh?

11:47.706 --> 11:49.834
I'm sure she just wanted a flute
and asked him for it.

11:50.418 --> 11:51.919
She's always been good at flattery,

11:52.002 --> 11:54.004
buttering people up
if she wants something.

11:54.088 --> 11:55.256
[Dang-gu sighs]

11:55.339 --> 11:58.717
I'm telling you, Yul was the first one
who knew she was taking the test.

11:58.801 --> 12:01.303
He even solved all the test questions
for her.

12:01.387 --> 12:04.432
Well, she just really wanted to get in.
You know?

12:04.515 --> 12:06.684
So she just asked Yul in advance.

12:07.893 --> 12:09.437
She'll do anything to get what she wants.

12:10.479 --> 12:11.814
No, I don't think so.

12:12.731 --> 12:16.360
I saw it. Those two being affectionate.

12:16.444 --> 12:17.945
- Hmm…
- [stutters]

12:19.155 --> 12:20.197
Affectionate?

12:20.281 --> 12:21.866
[snickers]

12:26.537 --> 12:30.040
[Dang-gu] Mu-deok and Yul met up outside,
just the two of them.

12:30.124 --> 12:31.041
And you…

12:31.542 --> 12:34.086
didn't know because you were stuck
in the Training Center.

12:34.628 --> 12:35.588
Oh, dear.

12:35.671 --> 12:37.965
[Dang-gu tuts, chuckles]

12:39.758 --> 12:42.011
I… I didn't know.

12:46.223 --> 12:49.351
[pensive music playing]

13:08.120 --> 13:09.747
What if it's really true?

13:10.331 --> 13:11.457
I missed you too. A lot.

13:11.540 --> 13:12.666
That's my response.

13:12.750 --> 13:15.085
[pensive music continues playing]

13:20.007 --> 13:21.133
Oh.

13:23.135 --> 13:25.346
She rejected my reply
because it was wrong.

13:26.305 --> 13:28.182
It wasn't, "I missed you, too."

13:28.265 --> 13:30.184
[intense stinger plays]

13:30.267 --> 13:32.061
Because she didn't miss me.

13:33.646 --> 13:34.688
[sighs]

13:36.774 --> 13:37.983
[chuckles]

13:38.067 --> 13:39.109
I think…

13:39.735 --> 13:41.904
I'd rather just take
actual poison and die.

13:41.987 --> 13:42.863
[scoffs]

13:43.364 --> 13:44.490
[sighs]

13:45.574 --> 13:46.700
Oh.

13:50.412 --> 13:51.705
Ugh, how embarrassing.

13:52.331 --> 13:53.582
[groans]

13:53.666 --> 13:55.668
[gentle music playing]

14:04.552 --> 14:05.803
I do love you.

14:06.595 --> 14:09.348
I can confidently tell you that I love you
a thousand times over.

14:13.894 --> 14:15.104
[sighs]

14:15.729 --> 14:17.356
Not that I know much at all,

14:18.607 --> 14:20.484
but I think that
if you really love somebody,

14:20.568 --> 14:22.027
you don't need to say it a thousand times.

14:24.029 --> 14:26.115
In fact, saying it even once
would be difficult.

14:26.907 --> 14:27.992
[sighs]

14:31.662 --> 14:33.080
Actually, you know, that whistle…

14:34.748 --> 14:37.877
it belongs to a friend
I was never able to say those words to.

14:39.753 --> 14:42.464
["Just Watching You"
by Jeong Se-woon playing]

14:46.594 --> 14:47.928
I really liked her.

14:57.313 --> 15:00.608
I really wanted to tell her those words.

15:06.030 --> 15:07.698
[young Naksu] I'd like to try it too.

15:08.616 --> 15:10.451
Let me try it.

15:10.534 --> 15:13.746
["Just Watching You" continues playing]

15:45.611 --> 15:46.946
[inhales sharply]

15:47.446 --> 15:48.364
[sighs]

15:48.447 --> 15:51.700
Since you're back in Songrim,
I imagine we'll run into each other.

15:54.620 --> 15:56.664
You can come and find me
if you're ever in trouble.

16:01.835 --> 16:03.253
Thank you, young master.

16:21.397 --> 16:23.482
[breathes deeply]

16:25.776 --> 16:28.612
[wind blowing]

16:28.696 --> 16:30.447
[Heo Yeom exclaims softly]

16:31.740 --> 16:34.159
So Uk managed to read
the Words of the Heart.

16:34.243 --> 16:35.285
[chuckles]

16:35.369 --> 16:37.329
You helped him, didn't you?

16:37.413 --> 16:42.167
I came here to let you know
in case you were wondering. [chuckles]

16:42.251 --> 16:46.547
Tell Jin he needs to hand over
the Words of the Heart back to Jinyowon.

16:47.214 --> 16:48.757
Oh, it's a bone.

16:48.841 --> 16:50.634
[chuckles]
Why is that?

16:51.760 --> 16:54.763
Uk was upset that the book was being
handed around for mages to read.

16:55.347 --> 16:58.976
Now that I think of it, I believe
Master Seo Gyeong would feel the same way.

16:59.059 --> 17:02.271
It seems you are quite fond of Uk, Master.
[chuckles]

17:02.354 --> 17:06.817
Hmm. He is exceptional.
So I ought to keep an eye on him.

17:06.900 --> 17:08.861
He's a very bright boy,

17:08.944 --> 17:12.364
but Jin is always trying to keep him
locked up away from the world.

17:13.615 --> 17:15.409
[tense music playing]

17:15.492 --> 17:16.994
[Jin] Is the ice stone…

17:17.619 --> 17:19.788
perhaps still somewhere in Songrim?

17:20.789 --> 17:22.541
And what makes you think so?

17:23.292 --> 17:24.543
Twenty years ago,

17:25.627 --> 17:28.047
Gwanju Jang Gang
performed the alchemy of souls.

17:30.007 --> 17:31.300
And through that spell,

17:31.383 --> 17:34.011
a child was born who should not have been.

17:35.012 --> 17:38.474
And then, the King's Star shone
in the night sky.

17:39.516 --> 17:41.268
And you know that child is Jang Uk?

17:42.102 --> 17:43.228
[Jin] Yes.

17:43.312 --> 17:47.691
A mage of Songrim brought the ice stone
back out into the world

17:48.442 --> 17:51.612
and using it,
finally had the son of a king.

17:53.864 --> 17:57.826
What's more, Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan
knows this as well.

17:59.703 --> 18:03.165
If the ice stone
has fallen into their hands,

18:03.832 --> 18:06.043
what reason can Songrim use…

18:08.170 --> 18:09.838
to take the stone from them?

18:14.343 --> 18:15.385
[clicks tongue]

18:15.469 --> 18:17.429
Since Jin has to protect Songrim,

18:17.513 --> 18:19.515
he has no choice but to lock Uk away.

18:20.057 --> 18:20.891
Why is that?

18:20.974 --> 18:24.728
Is there something else going on
that I'm not aware of?

18:28.649 --> 18:30.984
[ominous music playing]

18:34.029 --> 18:35.239
- [Master Lee] You.
- [gasps]

18:35.322 --> 18:39.451
Why would anyone tell you anything
when you're so clumsy and careless?

18:40.744 --> 18:43.831
- You… This is… Ugh!
- [Heo Yeom huffs]

18:43.914 --> 18:45.499
Will it come out if I wash it out?

18:45.582 --> 18:46.458
How…

18:47.918 --> 18:50.420
Oh. He is…

18:50.504 --> 18:54.508
angrier than when I told him
I was going to quit chaste training.

18:55.425 --> 18:56.426
Wait.

18:57.094 --> 19:00.931
That's the scarf Maidservant Kim gave him.

19:02.099 --> 19:03.267
Oh.

19:03.350 --> 19:06.395
[playful music playing]

19:09.106 --> 19:10.691
[man whispering]
I told you I can't.

19:10.774 --> 19:12.359
[man grunting]

19:21.827 --> 19:25.789
[woman] Let's hurry. We must finish
cleaning before the mages begin their day.

19:26.707 --> 19:27.541
[servants] Yes, ma'am.

19:30.127 --> 19:33.255
[thrilling music playing]

19:48.645 --> 19:49.938
[Mu-deok] Where's my young master?

19:50.022 --> 19:52.065
- He didn't come with you?
- [Dang-gu] Oh.

19:52.149 --> 19:53.400
I tried to wake him

19:53.483 --> 19:55.736
but he said he couldn't sleep last night.
He won't get up.

19:55.819 --> 19:58.071
You mean, he's still in bed?
On his first day?

19:58.155 --> 19:59.281
Hmm.

19:59.907 --> 20:01.158
- Hey. See you later.
- [gasps]

20:01.241 --> 20:02.159
Uh…

20:04.161 --> 20:05.204
[scoffs]

20:15.672 --> 20:16.840
[sighs]

20:18.926 --> 20:20.010
Young master.

20:20.093 --> 20:21.553
You have to get up.

20:23.263 --> 20:24.431
Young master!

20:28.143 --> 20:29.519
Move it.

20:29.603 --> 20:31.021
If you don't, I'll hit you, okay?

20:31.104 --> 20:32.272
Come on, wake up.

20:38.362 --> 20:39.404
[sighs]

20:41.531 --> 20:44.201
Stop bothering me.
I'm going to keep sleeping.

20:46.203 --> 20:48.664
Are you out of your damn mind?
You wanna die?

20:51.375 --> 20:53.043
Yes. I'm actually crazy. I want to die.

20:53.752 --> 20:55.754
What? What's wrong with you?

20:55.837 --> 20:58.382
It's just another symptom. I was poisoned.

20:58.465 --> 20:59.633
[sighs]

20:59.716 --> 21:02.678
Jang Uk. Why are you being so stubborn?

21:05.138 --> 21:06.723
I am your antidote.

21:08.225 --> 21:09.059
Yeah?

21:10.394 --> 21:12.104
[in sing-song tone]
Your cure.

21:15.148 --> 21:17.067
[playful music playing]

21:22.823 --> 21:24.825
[sighs]
I'm sorry.

21:24.908 --> 21:27.327
[quirky music playing]

21:29.037 --> 21:30.205
[Jang Uk sighs]

21:35.252 --> 21:36.420
[deep sigh]

21:38.338 --> 21:39.965
[Beom clears throat]
Uk.

21:41.300 --> 21:44.094
You read Words of the Heart? Impressive.

21:44.177 --> 21:45.846
It was nothing.

21:45.929 --> 21:48.265
I see you're reading about Hyeongong.

21:48.348 --> 21:50.559
I mastered that sword skill
when I was little.

21:51.184 --> 21:54.021
How about this? If you teach me
how to read Words of the Heart,

21:54.104 --> 21:55.814
I'll teach you Hyeongong in return.

21:58.525 --> 21:59.359
Well, maybe.

21:59.985 --> 22:01.862
[quirky music playing]

22:01.945 --> 22:04.072
[whispering]
Yes. Yes, I will.

22:05.741 --> 22:08.160
Listen. I am a bit too tired.

22:09.453 --> 22:12.497
Why don't you ask Master Lee
how to read Words of the Heart.

22:12.581 --> 22:13.707
[Mu-deok groans]

22:13.790 --> 22:16.209
[quirky music continues playing]

22:21.340 --> 22:22.382
Jang Uk.

22:23.091 --> 22:25.552
I also mastered Ryusu
around the same time you did.

22:26.178 --> 22:29.056
Would you be interested
in sparring with me once?

22:29.139 --> 22:34.436
I can lend you a very precious
sapphire mat that I use whenever I train.

22:34.519 --> 22:37.230
If you train with that,
it doubles your energy.

22:37.314 --> 22:40.609
A sapphire mat?
Those are very hard to come by, right?

22:40.692 --> 22:42.027
Mm-hmm.

22:42.110 --> 22:43.904
Young master, isn't that so wonderful?

22:43.987 --> 22:45.363
[quirky music continues playing]

22:46.239 --> 22:48.575
But they're really cold, aren't they?

22:49.367 --> 22:51.286
I tend to get cold easily these days.

22:52.370 --> 22:54.414
So I probably
do not need anything like that.

22:54.498 --> 22:55.791
[Jang Uk] Hmm.

23:02.547 --> 23:03.840
What are you doing?

23:05.217 --> 23:08.845
Oh, I haven't been sleeping well.
I'm taking a nap.

23:10.597 --> 23:13.725
You had a great opportunity
to learn Hyeongong and you missed it.

23:13.809 --> 23:14.810
Are you crazy?

23:14.893 --> 23:19.147
And yesterday, do you have any idea
how valuable a sapphire mat is?

23:19.231 --> 23:21.775
Even if you freeze to death,
you ought to train on that mat.

23:21.858 --> 23:24.486
Unbelievable. "You're crazy." "Just die."

23:24.569 --> 23:26.404
You can't stop talking to me like that?

23:26.488 --> 23:28.198
[quirky music playing]

23:28.281 --> 23:29.699
Forget it. Just give me that.

23:39.751 --> 23:40.752
[Jang Uk] What are you doing?

23:40.836 --> 23:42.379
You wanna nap together? We won't fit.

23:43.296 --> 23:45.132
If you want to nap,
you'll have to throw me off.

23:48.802 --> 23:49.970
Please move.

23:51.054 --> 23:52.222
Throw me off, then.

23:52.305 --> 23:55.183
Why would I throw you
when there's a better way?

23:56.643 --> 23:58.436
[gasps] Damn it.

23:59.479 --> 24:00.939
I swear…

24:02.315 --> 24:03.567
[Jang Uk sighs]

24:05.277 --> 24:06.194
You…

24:07.279 --> 24:08.280
Uh…

24:09.281 --> 24:11.074
I told a girl I missed her,

24:11.158 --> 24:14.744
but she said I was poisoned, so I need
to rest to recover from the shock,

24:14.828 --> 24:16.830
so stop pressuring me
and let me be alone for a while.

24:20.959 --> 24:23.628
I know you just wanna see me frustrated
while you make me wait.

24:25.005 --> 24:27.090
Like I said before,
if I die, we die together.

24:27.883 --> 24:30.635
Look, if I'm in agony,
you should at least be irritated.

24:30.719 --> 24:33.889
I have convulsions
in my sleep lately, you know.

24:39.853 --> 24:41.813
[sighs]
How long will this be, then?

24:43.023 --> 24:43.857
Who knows?

24:44.482 --> 24:46.109
Why? You're frustrated?

24:46.193 --> 24:48.153
[chuckles]
That will help me sleep well.

24:54.784 --> 24:57.120
[puffs, breathes deeply]

24:58.705 --> 25:01.541
Young Master Jang
is doing nothing but sleeping all day.

25:01.625 --> 25:04.085
Even if you have to beat him,
make him train.

25:04.169 --> 25:06.046
The mages of Jeongjingak train
on their own accord.

25:06.129 --> 25:09.216
[Sang-ho] How fast you master your energy
depends on your effort.

25:09.299 --> 25:11.676
As long as he follows protocols,
I won't interfere.

25:13.094 --> 25:14.012
I see, but--

25:14.095 --> 25:16.473
Don't worry about him.
He's right over there.

25:18.934 --> 25:20.060
[Jang Uk] Oh.

25:22.479 --> 25:25.148
Uh, I have a terrible headache.

25:25.232 --> 25:26.524
I'm going to head home

25:26.608 --> 25:29.110
and come back later
after a bath and some rest.

25:30.195 --> 25:31.238
[Mu-deok scoffs]

25:31.321 --> 25:33.657
Why does your head hurt
when you haven't done anything?

25:34.241 --> 25:35.867
And you can't just go home
whenever you please.

25:35.951 --> 25:37.244
That's totally against the rules.

25:37.327 --> 25:38.411
Isn't it?

25:38.495 --> 25:41.164
Uk's an exception.
The leader has given him permission.

25:41.748 --> 25:42.707
Wait. Why only him?

25:42.791 --> 25:45.794
Maybe you're too busy
having fun outside to know about this,

25:45.877 --> 25:48.797
but I made an agreement with the leader
when I was locked in here.

25:51.591 --> 25:52.592
Sir, I shall be back.

25:53.468 --> 25:56.012
[quirky music playing]

25:57.055 --> 25:58.598
I should probably be going with him.

26:00.058 --> 26:01.977
If you leave, you'll be fired on the spot.

26:02.060 --> 26:05.355
You fought hard for this job.
Do you not worry about losing it?

26:10.694 --> 26:11.653
Shh…

26:15.991 --> 26:18.076
Jang Uk has returned to his home.

26:18.159 --> 26:19.661
Are you sure it's okay to let him go?

26:19.744 --> 26:22.747
We'll let him continue doing
whatever he wants to.

26:24.874 --> 26:26.501
Let him stay lazy.

26:27.127 --> 26:28.003
[female mage] My lord.

26:28.086 --> 26:29.921
[footsteps approaching]

26:31.965 --> 26:34.467
Lady Jin of Jinyowon requested
that you wait a little longer.

26:35.302 --> 26:38.221
Is she with another visitor perhaps?

26:41.308 --> 26:44.102
[mysterious music playing]

26:44.185 --> 26:47.147
On our way in, I saw a servant
from Cheonbugwan.

26:47.230 --> 26:50.317
Do you think
Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu is here?

26:50.400 --> 26:54.988
They're not close enough
to visit each other like this.

26:56.156 --> 26:59.659
But just in case,
go and see if someone leaves.

27:10.837 --> 27:12.464
If that's Master Lee's wish,

27:12.547 --> 27:15.592
we'll store the Words of the Heart
safely in Jinyowon.

27:17.344 --> 27:20.305
Were you meeting with someone before me?

27:21.181 --> 27:22.640
A distant relative of mine.

27:24.809 --> 27:29.064
Has Young Lady Cho-yeon
been chosen as heir of Jinyowon?

27:31.066 --> 27:32.525
No. Not just yet…

27:33.401 --> 27:35.820
since my eldest daughter
might still be alive.

27:38.031 --> 27:40.241
I can't believe that she's been gone
for ten years.

27:41.451 --> 27:42.911
Although she couldn't see,

27:43.453 --> 27:47.415
she could feel energy
and control relics like no other.

27:47.499 --> 27:49.209
A very smart girl.

27:49.292 --> 27:50.710
Unlike other children,

27:51.628 --> 27:54.923
she was carried for 13 months.
She was quite special.

27:56.466 --> 27:59.302
She was born on the very day
that Jang Gang

27:59.386 --> 28:01.471
picked as blessed
from his reading of the sky.

28:02.097 --> 28:03.640
[ominous music playing]

28:03.723 --> 28:07.477
She was born on the exact day
that Jang Gang picked for you?

28:08.937 --> 28:10.105
Is it possible

28:10.188 --> 28:14.234
to choose the date and time
when a child will be born?

28:15.360 --> 28:16.903
It just happened to match.

28:18.571 --> 28:21.908
I would like to invite Master Lee
to Jinyowon someday.

28:22.492 --> 28:23.785
Please let him know that.

28:25.036 --> 28:26.121
Yes.

28:26.621 --> 28:29.582
[ominous music continues playing]

28:41.553 --> 28:43.930
[Ho-gyeong] I've born this child
for 13 months.

28:44.013 --> 28:47.058
I cannot say goodbye like this.

28:48.685 --> 28:50.562
I heard that the ice stone,

28:50.645 --> 28:53.982
that it has the power
to bring back dead souls.

28:54.566 --> 28:56.109
[Ho-gyeong breathes shakily]

28:56.943 --> 28:58.653
[sobbing]

29:00.196 --> 29:01.990
Gwanju, please.

29:03.366 --> 29:04.576
Please help me, sir.

29:05.368 --> 29:07.829
[melancholic music playing]

29:14.878 --> 29:18.882
[Ho-gyeong] I went to the ends
of the earth not to lose this child.

29:19.591 --> 29:22.051
[somber music playing]

29:30.852 --> 29:32.103
I will find you.

29:34.522 --> 29:36.691
No matter what things I have to do…

29:38.526 --> 29:39.861
I will find you.

29:51.790 --> 29:54.834
- Did you find out who came here before us?
- Yes.

29:56.377 --> 29:59.839
[Sang-ho] As we suspected,
it was Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu.

30:02.550 --> 30:04.302
[Jin] Since when
did the leader of Jinyowon

30:04.385 --> 30:07.639
acknowledge him as family,
let alone meet with him like this?

30:07.722 --> 30:09.557
He left quietly
through the back gate, sir.

30:10.308 --> 30:13.019
They must have a secret deal
they don't want me to know about.

30:14.187 --> 30:16.898
I wonder what that traitorous, Jin Mu,

30:16.981 --> 30:19.943
could be using as bait
to get inside Jinyowon.

30:24.656 --> 30:27.116
[ominous music playing]

30:37.293 --> 30:40.672
[Yeom-su] None of you are able to see,
so you can find out where you are.

30:41.798 --> 30:44.801
If you do as you're told
and stay completely silent,

30:45.385 --> 30:46.928
you'll be spared and released.

30:47.554 --> 30:49.389
Do not make a sound.

30:49.472 --> 30:50.557
Stand up.

30:51.641 --> 30:53.893
[shaky breathing]

32:10.887 --> 32:12.055
[Yeom-su] Sit down.

32:20.313 --> 32:22.941
Leave that one here.
The other ones can go.

32:26.486 --> 32:28.738
[So-i] They're looking for the girl
in that portrait.

32:28.821 --> 32:30.323
She must be blind.

32:31.366 --> 32:34.327
He said the others could leave,
but why is there no movement?

32:36.079 --> 32:38.247
[breathes deeply]

32:48.383 --> 32:49.634
[exclaims]

32:50.593 --> 32:51.928
[gasps]

32:53.096 --> 32:55.556
[suspenseful music playing]

33:03.898 --> 33:05.400
So you can actually see.

33:07.694 --> 33:10.905
Well, that's a pity. I almost thought
I'd found a suitable girl.

33:11.739 --> 33:12.657
Kill her.

33:16.244 --> 33:17.870
No, wait. I can do it.

33:19.747 --> 33:23.334
I can be that girl.
The one in the portrait.

33:29.298 --> 33:30.508
Please just let me live.

33:31.217 --> 33:32.885
Didn't you say I was suitable?

33:34.137 --> 33:36.055
If what you really need
is a blind girl, then…

33:38.850 --> 33:41.185
from this point on,
I will forever be blind.

33:41.811 --> 33:43.855
[mysterious music playing]

33:43.938 --> 33:45.773
[shaky breathing]

33:55.783 --> 33:58.995
You're really something. Stand up.

34:01.998 --> 34:04.333
[So-i breathing shakily]

34:04.917 --> 34:07.086
You think you can pretend to be blind?

34:07.920 --> 34:09.589
I really am blind, sir.

34:13.134 --> 34:15.595
Then let me see how convincing you can be.

34:15.678 --> 34:17.847
[foreboding music playing]

34:21.601 --> 34:22.810
[glass shattering]

34:32.820 --> 34:33.821
[energy whooshes]

34:33.905 --> 34:35.114
[glass clinks]

34:45.875 --> 34:47.376
[glass clinking]

34:53.966 --> 34:56.803
[Jin Mu]
Seems I really have found a suitable girl.

35:00.723 --> 35:02.266
[sword clinks]

35:03.559 --> 35:04.602
[sword rasps]

35:06.187 --> 35:08.314
[thrilling music playing]

35:16.405 --> 35:17.865
You will do.

35:17.949 --> 35:21.953
From now on, you'll live as Jin Bu-yeon,
the lost daughter of Jinyowon.

35:23.079 --> 35:24.122
Yes.

35:25.289 --> 35:27.125
Yes, I am Jin Bu-yeon.

35:39.303 --> 35:41.305
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk has stopped again.

35:45.768 --> 35:48.688
What cliff do I have to push him off
of this time?

35:54.569 --> 35:56.737
[Go Won] You are working hard,
thanks to me.

36:01.200 --> 36:02.118
Yes.

36:02.702 --> 36:05.955
Thanks to you, I'm going to have
to sweep this yard all over again.

36:13.379 --> 36:14.630
[Go Won] You're complaining?

36:15.173 --> 36:16.841
I'll have you dismissed.

36:16.924 --> 36:18.259
You cheated your way in.

36:18.801 --> 36:20.928
If I open my mouth,
you'll be fired immediately.

36:23.222 --> 36:24.807
Forgive me, Your Highness.

36:25.892 --> 36:28.978
It would be my honor
just to sweep up after you,

36:29.061 --> 36:31.606
so please, continue on your way,
Your Highness.

36:33.399 --> 36:35.067
What you should be honored to receive…

36:36.027 --> 36:38.487
is the answer sheet I gave you,
not these little leaves.

36:38.571 --> 36:39.947
Ah.

36:40.531 --> 36:41.824
I see, Your Highness.

36:41.908 --> 36:45.453
You weren't being crossed.
You just wanted to take credit.

36:45.536 --> 36:48.247
Goodness, I was too slow to notice.

36:48.331 --> 36:50.249
I'm so grateful, Your Highness.

36:51.042 --> 36:54.128
As you should be.
You know, I solved those questions myself.

36:55.671 --> 36:58.090
I bet you don't even know
how to get rid of ink stains?

36:59.467 --> 37:02.595
You mean, you solved that question
yourself, Your Highness?

37:03.262 --> 37:06.015
Yeah. I am the Crown Prince,

37:06.098 --> 37:08.601
but I still learned that rice paste
gets rid of ink stains.

37:09.227 --> 37:12.313
I even tried it myself,
and it actually worked.

37:13.022 --> 37:14.398
It's just unbelievable, huh.

37:14.899 --> 37:18.110
- Goodness. I am forever indebted to you.
- [Go Won clears throat]

37:18.694 --> 37:20.821
[clicks tongue]
Well then,

37:21.739 --> 37:23.241
are you happy to be with your master?

37:24.659 --> 37:26.285
I heard he read the Words of the Heart.

37:26.369 --> 37:27.453
Yes.

37:27.536 --> 37:30.831
And he was able to read it in less time
than any other mage in Jeongjingak.

37:34.085 --> 37:36.003
I don't doubt it with his skills.

37:36.587 --> 37:38.256
He probably got lucky again
like last time.

37:39.298 --> 37:42.093
Your Royal Highness,
he did beat you in a duel once.

37:42.677 --> 37:43.678
[scoffs]

37:45.304 --> 37:48.683
I know the extent of Jang Uk's skills
very well.

37:50.309 --> 37:53.104
He has bad swordsmanship and weak spells.

37:53.187 --> 37:56.899
He got lucky and beat me by using Tansu.
It was not because he was skilled.

37:58.150 --> 37:59.944
[Mu-deok] He knows him very well.

38:00.987 --> 38:04.615
Well, that's why he came to Jeongjingak.
To work on his skills.

38:04.699 --> 38:07.827
To be honest, he doesn't even have
what it takes to enter Jeongjingak.

38:08.494 --> 38:11.914
If he manages to beat anyone
in sparring even once,

38:12.665 --> 38:14.292
then I will finally acknowledge him.

38:15.584 --> 38:18.629
[Mu-deok] Right. Using the Crown Prince
isn't a bad idea.

38:18.713 --> 38:19.797
Sire.

38:20.339 --> 38:23.718
I have an idea.
Why don't you and I bet on this?

38:24.552 --> 38:25.720
A bet?

38:27.054 --> 38:29.181
What could I gain
from betting with a servant?

38:30.391 --> 38:34.228
I'll bet you the most precious thing
that I have with me.

38:42.486 --> 38:43.863
[Jang Uk] Or I can just choose.

38:43.946 --> 38:45.823
I pick red. You can have blue.

38:46.324 --> 38:47.742
[pensive music playing]

38:54.498 --> 38:55.875
[Jang Uk] I missed you too. A lot.

38:57.335 --> 38:58.669
That's my response.

39:04.133 --> 39:05.259
[sighs]

39:08.763 --> 39:10.389
- Young master.
- Oh.

39:11.015 --> 39:13.100
[maid Kim]
I brought the honey biscuits you like.

39:13.934 --> 39:15.394
You'll be staying for dinner, right?

39:15.478 --> 39:18.356
- Actually, I'm staying a few days.
- Hmm?

39:18.439 --> 39:21.650
- Is that allowed?
- I told you, I got permission.

39:21.734 --> 39:23.986
I'm totally exempt.
[grunts]

39:24.070 --> 39:25.363
As you should be.

39:25.446 --> 39:28.199
You managed to read
the Words of the Heart in a few days.

39:28.282 --> 39:31.452
It'd be absurd to make you follow
the same rules as ordinary mages.

39:31.535 --> 39:34.914
- [chuckles]
- So you're satisfied? I did well?

39:34.997 --> 39:36.832
You are really asking that?

39:36.916 --> 39:39.210
I am positively brimming
with so much pride.

39:39.293 --> 39:41.087
[both chuckle]

39:41.170 --> 39:42.463
[sighs]
Maidservant Kim.

39:42.546 --> 39:44.715
I know that I've been
a disappointment to you before,

39:44.799 --> 39:46.175
but now, you can hold your head high.

39:46.258 --> 39:49.095
Should I get you a nice dress
so you can show it off to everybody?

39:49.178 --> 39:50.596
Goodness.
[chuckles]

39:50.679 --> 39:54.725
These days, I feel warm without clothes
and I'm full without eating food.

39:54.809 --> 39:57.353
[soft chuckle]
People come up to me.

39:57.436 --> 40:00.940
They say, "Jang Uk's really proven
to be his father's son."

40:02.775 --> 40:03.776
Really?

40:04.360 --> 40:06.654
Jang Gang also used to be called a genius.

40:06.737 --> 40:08.322
They all say you're just like him

40:08.406 --> 40:10.241
and that you have inherited
all of his talents.

40:12.243 --> 40:14.745
People used to say
I was nothing like him at all.

40:16.664 --> 40:17.915
Hmm.

40:17.998 --> 40:19.625
The more you achieve,

40:20.292 --> 40:23.963
the less people will say things like that
about you.

40:24.046 --> 40:27.216
And if I don't?
I guess they'll go back to saying it.

40:29.093 --> 40:30.219
Well, I don't know what…

40:31.554 --> 40:34.640
If they say I'm not,
tell them to say what they want.

40:34.723 --> 40:36.016
I don't care about it anymore.

40:37.059 --> 40:39.895
That's right. We won't let them
bother us anymore.

40:41.939 --> 40:46.902
In truth, you are the only one
who's responsible for your achievements.

40:46.986 --> 40:48.362
What's it got to do with your father?

40:49.071 --> 40:51.449
To speak frankly,
what's he ever done for you?

40:52.032 --> 40:55.703
What's more,
to be honest, well, that's all

40:55.786 --> 40:57.163
because I raised you well.

40:57.246 --> 40:58.247
[Jang Uk chuckles softly]

40:58.998 --> 41:00.583
[maid Kim chuckles]

41:02.042 --> 41:03.085
[sighs]

41:03.961 --> 41:07.006
You know, whether you're a genius

41:07.923 --> 41:11.927
or a complete failure,
you'll always be my young master.

41:12.011 --> 41:13.053
Really?

41:14.555 --> 41:18.058
Then can I just return
to living a carefree life like before?

41:20.019 --> 41:21.770
Yes, if that is what you really want.

41:22.563 --> 41:25.024
But I thought you actually hated
living like that.

41:26.567 --> 41:30.237
Compared to when you used
to live that way at home,

41:30.321 --> 41:33.532
I got the sense that you became
so much happier…

41:34.533 --> 41:36.160
after training at Danhyanggok.

41:37.745 --> 41:40.414
That's why I couldn't stop you
even though it was dangerous.

41:41.040 --> 41:42.082
You see,

41:42.625 --> 41:45.044
I want you to be able to achieve it all.

41:45.794 --> 41:47.713
Everything you would like to achieve.

41:50.049 --> 41:51.175
All right.

41:52.218 --> 41:53.344
Hmm.

41:55.179 --> 41:56.514
I should go back now.

41:57.598 --> 41:59.266
[stammers]
You are leaving?

41:59.350 --> 42:02.895
Yes. If you'd forced me to leave,
I would have refused to go.

42:02.978 --> 42:05.064
But after that speech, I knew I should go.

42:05.147 --> 42:08.776
Do whatever I can, huh?
To make you even more proud.

42:09.735 --> 42:12.530
Oh. What about your headache?
Is it any better now?

42:13.239 --> 42:14.365
Mm-hm.

42:15.241 --> 42:17.243
I guess that the carrot-and-stick approach

42:17.326 --> 42:19.578
can work as well on humans
as it does on horses.

42:20.788 --> 42:23.874
And, well, recently, I got hit
with a very hefty stick.

42:24.458 --> 42:27.336
What? Who had the audacity
to hit my young master?

42:27.419 --> 42:29.880
Don't worry.
I'm not going to take it lying down.

42:31.840 --> 42:33.342
Just pack some snacks for me.

42:33.425 --> 42:34.843
Honey biscuits.

42:35.803 --> 42:37.388
[indistinct chatter]

42:39.598 --> 42:40.683
[Yeol] Jang Uk.

42:41.976 --> 42:43.102
You're back.

42:43.185 --> 42:44.436
Mm. Yes.

42:45.521 --> 42:47.648
Why does it feel like
you've all been waiting for me?

42:48.440 --> 42:50.901
Did everybody hear how delicious
the honey biscuits are?

42:50.985 --> 42:54.071
The Training Center.
You should check it out now.

42:57.032 --> 42:58.909
[upbeat music playing]

43:05.541 --> 43:07.626
- You've all been waiting for me?
- [Hyo] Yes.

43:07.710 --> 43:10.462
And I'm gonna be your very first opponent.
So get ready.

43:11.964 --> 43:12.798
What?

43:13.549 --> 43:15.342
I'm challenging you to spar with me.

43:16.093 --> 43:18.137
If you refuse me, you forfeit.

43:19.013 --> 43:20.472
Wait a minute. What are you talking about?

43:24.476 --> 43:26.103
[Mu-deok] Here, you can use this.

43:26.186 --> 43:27.938
[tense music playing]

43:39.241 --> 43:40.409
Hah!

43:41.368 --> 43:42.745
[sword rasps]

43:42.828 --> 43:43.829
[Jang Uk grunts]

43:44.913 --> 43:46.206
[Jang Uk grumbles]

43:51.045 --> 43:52.296
[exhales]

43:55.633 --> 43:56.717
[Go Won] Jang Uk has lost.

43:56.800 --> 43:57.843
[Jang Uk exhales]

43:58.510 --> 44:01.430
Gu Hyo is the winner here.
You may take the first toad.

44:29.124 --> 44:30.668
What's this? What are you doing?

44:30.751 --> 44:32.002
Well, you see, I made a bet.

44:32.086 --> 44:34.380
But I've never made any bet with you,
Your Royal Highness.

44:34.463 --> 44:37.216
Not with you.
I made a bet with your servant there.

44:37.800 --> 44:38.842
[sighs]

44:41.303 --> 44:44.515
[Go Won] I told her that you didn't have
the skills to beat any of the mages

44:44.598 --> 44:45.974
here in a sparring match.

44:46.058 --> 44:49.061
But she insisted that you could beat
at least one out of ten and bet on it.

44:49.978 --> 44:51.814
Ah, Mu-deok said that?

44:53.774 --> 44:56.110
You'll fight one match a day for ten days.

44:56.193 --> 44:58.028
And if you fail to win a single fight,

44:58.112 --> 45:00.572
she's agreed to give me the thing
most valuable to her.

45:02.282 --> 45:03.367
Valuable?

45:04.660 --> 45:06.245
You don't have anything valuable though.

45:06.870 --> 45:08.622
It was something that you gave me.

45:11.208 --> 45:12.918
This is what she has bet with me.

45:14.420 --> 45:16.255
[somber music playing]

45:18.882 --> 45:20.092
[sighs]

45:21.677 --> 45:24.304
This jade looks valuable to me,
so I'd like to keep it around.

45:26.515 --> 45:28.308
I've brought these gold toads as prizes

45:28.392 --> 45:29.977
for those who win against you.

45:33.480 --> 45:34.690
[inhales deeply]

45:36.650 --> 45:40.446
If you are unable to win a single match
before all those toads disappear,

45:40.529 --> 45:41.947
this will be mine.

45:42.573 --> 45:44.825
I'm not interested
in taking a part of your bet.

45:45.659 --> 45:48.412
It's true, you're not.
I made the bet with her.

45:50.164 --> 45:51.498
If you give up,

45:51.582 --> 45:54.084
you won't have won a single match,
so she'll lose.

45:54.960 --> 45:56.086
And this will be mine.

46:00.799 --> 46:01.925
[Mu-deok] Young master.

46:03.177 --> 46:05.846
That is the most precious thing
I have ever owned in my life.

46:07.806 --> 46:11.310
Please, try to win just once
and win it back for me.

46:12.102 --> 46:14.396
[thrilling music playing]

46:22.446 --> 46:23.489
Whoa.

46:24.114 --> 46:25.741
I can't believe you won it.

46:25.824 --> 46:29.369
[Hyo] Of course, I did. Uk may have
managed to read the Words of the Heart,

46:29.453 --> 46:31.788
- but he's not much into swordfight.
- [Seo Yul] What's going on?

46:31.872 --> 46:33.624
- [mages laughing]
- [mage 1] Tomorrow, I'll win one.

46:33.707 --> 46:36.543
Mu-deok and the Prince
just made a bet together about Uk.

46:36.627 --> 46:37.586
[Yeol] Hey, be careful.

46:37.669 --> 46:40.839
The Prince is providing prizes of gold,
so everyone wants in.

46:40.923 --> 46:42.174
[mage 1] If I will win,
I'll let you touch mine.

46:42.257 --> 46:44.218
The strongest ones
are lining up for the fight,

46:44.301 --> 46:45.928
they all think they'll win.

46:46.011 --> 46:49.264
- [mages laugh]
- No, I'm gonna win one.

46:53.477 --> 46:54.686
[exasperated sigh]

46:56.230 --> 46:58.732
The Crown Prince was mocking
your incompetence.

46:59.274 --> 47:01.276
And as your master,
I couldn't let that slide.

47:01.360 --> 47:02.694
Do not lie to me.

47:03.362 --> 47:04.863
You think I don't know you?

47:05.531 --> 47:07.157
You thought I wouldn't realize

47:07.241 --> 47:09.701
that you made the bet
just to force me to resume my training?

47:10.702 --> 47:12.120
[sighs]

47:12.204 --> 47:13.121
You're right.

47:14.665 --> 47:16.500
But now, whether you like it or not,

47:16.583 --> 47:19.503
you'll have to fight ten matches
against ten mages.

47:20.462 --> 47:23.632
At your first match today,
I was extremely disappointed.

47:24.258 --> 47:26.343
Your sword was slow
and your feet were heavy.

47:26.426 --> 47:27.844
Tomorrow's opponent
is from the Jung family.

47:27.928 --> 47:29.096
- So--
- I won't.

47:32.975 --> 47:36.562
Even if you lose, you'll learn something.
I'm sure you'll pick up some skills.

47:36.645 --> 47:39.648
- I told you I won't.
- As you fight ten mages,

47:39.731 --> 47:42.234
you'll also be learning
ten different spells every time.

47:43.068 --> 47:44.570
- Hey, Mu-deok--
- Young master.

47:44.653 --> 47:46.822
If you want to go back home tomorrow,
go ahead.

47:46.905 --> 47:49.199
But then you will never get
that jade back.

47:50.784 --> 47:51.910
All right, fine.

47:52.953 --> 47:54.538
I get this ridiculous bet.

47:55.122 --> 47:56.123
But how…

47:57.291 --> 47:59.001
how could you just bet that though?

47:59.710 --> 48:00.836
You know how.

48:01.336 --> 48:04.798
It was only thing I could think of
to motivate you to fight your hardest.

48:07.718 --> 48:11.346
So this is what you meant that day
when you told me that you had my weakness?

48:12.139 --> 48:14.099
[somber music playing]

48:14.182 --> 48:15.309
That's right.

48:16.685 --> 48:18.478
Even if you despise me now,

48:19.688 --> 48:22.524
I know you could never stand to lose
what we shared with someone else.

48:25.027 --> 48:26.153
Wow.

48:27.321 --> 48:29.615
So this is why you said
you poisoned me, huh?

48:29.698 --> 48:31.992
But if you get it back,
I'll give you a smile.

48:32.909 --> 48:34.286
Like an antidote.

48:38.790 --> 48:39.916
Jang Uk.

48:41.251 --> 48:42.753
Please get it back for me.

48:43.837 --> 48:45.631
Because it is the most precious thing…

48:47.674 --> 48:49.301
that I've ever had in my life.

48:52.012 --> 48:53.180
It's precious to you?

48:54.431 --> 48:55.390
Not…

48:57.142 --> 48:58.560
because it's expensive?

49:04.316 --> 49:06.276
I'll make sure to get it back
from the Prince.

49:07.152 --> 49:09.196
Because it'd be strange
to share it with him.

49:13.617 --> 49:14.576
Ah.

49:16.244 --> 49:18.246
I guess it was strange
to share it with you too.

49:20.916 --> 49:23.418
[somber music continues playing]

49:40.352 --> 49:42.979
[Jin Mu] I heard you've been visiting
Sejukwon often.

49:43.605 --> 49:46.983
Is that because you wish
to take Master Heo as your master

49:47.067 --> 49:48.694
and learn spells from him?

49:50.946 --> 49:51.822
How silly.

49:52.906 --> 49:54.741
You know you're my master.

49:55.826 --> 49:57.577
[Go Won] I just go there for treatment.

49:57.661 --> 50:01.289
Get some fresh air.
Not to mention, it's fun.

50:01.373 --> 50:05.043
I'm sure you must enjoy spending time
with the mages of Songrim.

50:05.127 --> 50:07.295
I do get to see my cousin Yul.

50:07.379 --> 50:09.548
And I actually like Park Dang-gu as well.

50:09.631 --> 50:12.884
But Jang Uk, I wanna teach him a lesson,
but it's not easy.

50:13.427 --> 50:15.971
He was pleased with himself
after reading  Words of the Heart,

50:16.054 --> 50:18.014
so I put him in his place today.

50:18.098 --> 50:20.600
He lost to a mage
who only just mastered Ryusu.

50:20.684 --> 50:22.811
So people know his true competence now.

50:22.894 --> 50:24.604
They do not admire him anymore.

50:29.443 --> 50:31.528
[ominous music playing]

50:31.611 --> 50:32.946
That's a nice jade.

50:33.655 --> 50:35.657
I got it for ten gold toads.

50:36.825 --> 50:39.619
- Is it valuable?
- That blue jade holds yin energy.

50:40.328 --> 50:42.247
Do you know where the other one is?

50:42.330 --> 50:43.373
Other one?

50:43.457 --> 50:45.876
Opposite energies only ever come in pairs.

50:45.959 --> 50:48.837
[Jin Mu] If there's a blue jade,
there's a red to go with it.

50:48.920 --> 50:51.089
They're only valuable
when they're together.

50:55.844 --> 50:57.304
[Go Won] So this should be a pair?

50:58.096 --> 50:59.181
Eunuch Oh.

51:00.056 --> 51:02.601
What does it mean
when two people share paired tokens?

51:02.684 --> 51:04.770
That they're married or lovers.

51:05.353 --> 51:07.147
[quirky music playing]

51:07.230 --> 51:08.690
[groans]

51:09.316 --> 51:12.360
Why? Do you not like the jade,
Your Highness?

51:12.444 --> 51:16.281
No. I don't know. It gets on my nerves.

51:16.364 --> 51:19.284
Just go take it and throw it away, huh?

51:19.367 --> 51:21.995
[Oh] I don't think you should do that yet,
Your Highness.

51:22.078 --> 51:23.747
Jang Uk might still win it back.

51:26.208 --> 51:28.001
If he does take it back,

51:28.794 --> 51:30.295
that means it will be a pair again.

51:31.713 --> 51:33.465
[grunts, sucks teeth]

51:40.430 --> 51:41.723
[sighs]

51:43.934 --> 51:45.101
Huh.

51:45.185 --> 51:46.353
- [maid Kim] Master Lee.
- Yes!

51:46.436 --> 51:47.354
Oh.

51:47.938 --> 51:49.397
[maid Kim chuckles softly]

51:49.481 --> 51:51.942
What kind of business brings you here?

51:52.025 --> 51:53.485
[breathes deeply]

51:54.277 --> 51:56.988
I've never felt cold
no matter what I wear.

51:57.823 --> 51:58.657
But…

51:59.658 --> 52:01.368
after wearing this,

52:02.244 --> 52:04.412
I realized how cold I'd been all along.

52:04.496 --> 52:05.789
Ah…

52:06.915 --> 52:08.542
Wait. What is that over there?

52:09.167 --> 52:10.544
[maid Kim] Hmm?

52:10.627 --> 52:13.046
Huh? What… Oh, my.

52:13.129 --> 52:15.257
[whimsical music playing]

52:17.008 --> 52:20.679
I never really thought much
about flowers before,

52:22.097 --> 52:25.892
and yet, when I saw these,
I wanted to show them to you.

52:31.898 --> 52:33.066
[chuckles]

52:33.149 --> 52:34.401
Oh, how pretty.

52:35.694 --> 52:38.238
Are these flowers for me?

52:40.574 --> 52:42.576
[soft chuckle]

52:43.535 --> 52:45.996
[both laugh nervously]

52:46.079 --> 52:49.457
These books… These books are
These… These books are very good.

52:49.541 --> 52:50.542
- Oh.
- [Master Lee clears throat]

52:50.625 --> 52:52.377
Ah. What a great read.

52:52.460 --> 52:54.212
[both laugh]

52:54.296 --> 52:55.297
[Master Lee clears throat]

52:59.426 --> 53:00.635
Do you know…

53:02.012 --> 53:05.307
if Maidservant Kim is unwell?
I haven't seen her.

53:05.390 --> 53:06.933
She went to Songrim yesterday.

53:07.559 --> 53:09.477
[man]
She often goes to see Young Master Jang.

53:10.812 --> 53:11.897
I see.

53:11.980 --> 53:13.481
[chuckles]

53:14.024 --> 53:16.234
She just didn't come by to see me.

53:16.318 --> 53:17.193
Mm.

53:18.528 --> 53:20.780
She also has a visitor right now.

53:20.864 --> 53:22.657
She does? Who could it be?

53:22.741 --> 53:26.161
I'm not sure what his name is
but I can say he was a young man.

53:26.953 --> 53:28.371
A young man you say?

53:29.372 --> 53:33.043
I don't know of any young men who would
come to visit Maidservant Kim though.

53:34.169 --> 53:36.379
[breathes deeply]

53:38.924 --> 53:41.760
[tranquil music playing]

53:42.969 --> 53:45.388
- [Jin] Oh. Maidservant Kim.
- [maid Kim] Hmm?

53:45.472 --> 53:47.098
- [Jin chuckles]
- [maid Kim] Hmm.

53:47.182 --> 53:48.975
[Jin pants, breathes deeply]

53:50.310 --> 53:51.978
- Can I help you?
- [exhales]

53:53.355 --> 53:55.065
What are those weeds there?

53:55.148 --> 53:56.942
Can't you tell they're flowers?

53:57.817 --> 54:00.028
- They're not weeds.
- [Jin] Maidservant Kim.

54:00.528 --> 54:04.115
Is the reason why you stopped visiting
because of how…

54:04.908 --> 54:07.369
- harsh I was to you that day?
- Hmm.

54:07.452 --> 54:10.956
I came all this way
because I thought you were sick.

54:11.039 --> 54:13.083
Though it seems that I've wasted my time.

54:13.166 --> 54:14.876
Well then, why did you come at all?

54:15.502 --> 54:17.587
I thought you swore
that you were never going to visit again.

54:17.671 --> 54:19.673
I never swore anything like that.

54:19.756 --> 54:21.174
You were the one who got angry.

54:21.257 --> 54:22.509
- [maid Kim] Hmm.
- [Jin sucks teeth]

54:22.592 --> 54:24.177
But still,

54:24.260 --> 54:26.554
I'm glad that you're well.

54:28.348 --> 54:29.724
[Jin chuckles]

54:32.435 --> 54:34.604
If you were actually worried
that I might be sick,

54:35.772 --> 54:38.733
you could have at least brought
a bundle of weeds.

54:38.817 --> 54:40.652
I can get some weeds for you?

54:41.236 --> 54:42.362
I'll go and pick some now.

54:44.114 --> 54:45.323
Even if I don't need them.

54:45.907 --> 54:49.911
What I really want from you isn't weeds.
I want flowers, you fool…

54:52.038 --> 54:53.623
to show me that you

54:53.707 --> 54:55.291
think of me like that.

54:56.376 --> 54:58.169
Like something that is beautiful.

54:59.129 --> 55:02.007
[pensive music playing]

55:04.968 --> 55:08.054
My guest is still waiting,
so you should go.

55:08.138 --> 55:10.223
Uh, Maid Kim.

55:11.307 --> 55:12.267
Well…

55:13.810 --> 55:17.397
the next time you come to visit Uk,

55:19.190 --> 55:21.735
please come visit me too.

55:24.529 --> 55:26.823
Um… wait.

55:28.366 --> 55:29.242
[sighs]

55:30.368 --> 55:31.995
Is she just sending me away…

55:33.163 --> 55:34.914
because I came here empty-handed?

55:36.875 --> 55:38.084
Well, that's just…

55:40.336 --> 55:41.755
cold-hearted.

55:41.838 --> 55:43.673
[breathes deeply]

56:01.858 --> 56:04.527
[playful music playing]

56:04.611 --> 56:05.904
[sucks teeth]

56:06.613 --> 56:09.449
Seeing that his shoes
are quite a bit smaller than mine,

56:10.909 --> 56:12.786
he must be shorter than I am.

56:14.329 --> 56:16.331
[shoe scraping]

56:17.499 --> 56:20.543
[playful music continues playing]

56:27.634 --> 56:29.928
Do you like sweets at all?

56:30.011 --> 56:30.887
Yes.

56:31.638 --> 56:34.557
[whimsical music playing]

56:37.227 --> 56:38.394
It's delicious.

56:39.646 --> 56:41.439
Then have another.

56:42.607 --> 56:44.526
Oh. For me.

56:45.318 --> 56:48.530
[whimsical music continues playing]

56:58.957 --> 57:01.000
- You like it?
- It's pretty.

57:01.084 --> 57:02.752
- You try this one.
- Me?

57:02.836 --> 57:03.753
[stammers]
How is it?

57:03.837 --> 57:05.713
- Uh, over here.
- Ah.

57:06.297 --> 57:07.841
[giggles]

57:10.760 --> 57:11.928
[soft gasp]

57:12.512 --> 57:13.429
Oh-oh.

57:16.141 --> 57:17.392
[Dang-gu sighs]

57:18.768 --> 57:20.979
[stammers]
Oh, over there.

57:21.062 --> 57:22.564
[Dang-gu] There's a flower shop.

57:23.231 --> 57:25.275
You said you wanted to buy some flowers.

57:25.358 --> 57:28.570
I need to buy some flowers
to decorate Bu-yeon's room.

57:28.653 --> 57:30.113
Ah.

57:30.196 --> 57:33.867
After all, this might be the time
that we finally find her.

57:34.492 --> 57:35.577
Ah.

57:37.245 --> 57:38.455
[inaudible whisper]

57:40.915 --> 57:44.085
Oh, really? Jin Mu will?

57:44.169 --> 57:45.044
Shh.

57:45.545 --> 57:47.088
It's just… It's still a secret.

57:48.256 --> 57:51.384
I really do hope
that Bu-yeon finally comes back.

57:51.468 --> 57:52.302
But then,

57:52.385 --> 57:55.263
doesn't that mean that you won't become
the next leader of Jinyowon?

57:55.346 --> 57:58.558
Instead, I'll be free to marry who I want.

57:59.601 --> 58:03.313
I'll be allowed to marry
the man who I love the most.

58:04.731 --> 58:06.316
[chuckles]
Good to know.

58:08.735 --> 58:11.279
Then we should hurry up
and break off our fake engagement.

58:11.362 --> 58:14.741
Thank you for pretending with me.
It must have been hard.

58:14.824 --> 58:15.950
[sighs]

58:17.410 --> 58:18.870
I've never pretended.

58:19.454 --> 58:20.705
[tranquil music playing]

58:20.788 --> 58:21.789
My feelings…

58:23.291 --> 58:24.751
were always sincere for you.

58:28.421 --> 58:29.839
[Cho-yeon] But you're the heir to Songrim.

58:29.923 --> 58:33.718
How could you think of marrying me
when you'd have to move in with my family?

58:33.801 --> 58:34.928
[sighs]

58:35.011 --> 58:35.929
I know.

58:36.971 --> 58:38.181
I was worried for nothing.

58:38.765 --> 58:40.850
I was even up all night
worrying that I would be…

58:42.018 --> 58:43.436
kicked out of the family.

58:43.520 --> 58:44.604
[gasps]

58:45.146 --> 58:46.481
Do you mean that?

58:47.315 --> 58:50.985
You actually would be willing to give up
being Songrim's heir to be with me?

58:51.069 --> 58:53.738
You said you'd rather die
than have a loveless marriage.

58:54.864 --> 58:56.616
I thought that if I married you,

58:56.699 --> 58:58.826
then you would at least
spend your life with a man…

59:01.371 --> 59:02.539
who loved you.

59:03.748 --> 59:07.418
Anyway, you should find a man
that you have real feelings for.

59:08.628 --> 59:09.796
[Dang-gu sighs]

59:15.176 --> 59:16.594
[breathes deeply]

59:18.888 --> 59:19.973
[sighs]

59:24.978 --> 59:27.814
[tranquil music playing]

59:34.362 --> 59:36.239
What if I already…

59:37.949 --> 59:38.908
met him.

59:42.078 --> 59:43.538
[Cho-yeon breathes deeply]

59:45.039 --> 59:47.959
I-if you keep holding me,

59:52.755 --> 59:54.591
then I'll never be able
to let go of you again.

59:54.674 --> 59:57.427
- [Cho-yeon gasps]
- There's no turning back now.

59:58.720 --> 01:00:00.638
Not when I'm feeling like this.

01:00:01.764 --> 01:00:02.765
[chuckles softly]

01:00:10.356 --> 01:00:13.610
If I'm gonna propose to you properly,
then we'll need a lot of flowers.

01:00:17.447 --> 01:00:18.656
Let's go now.

01:00:23.494 --> 01:00:25.163
[Jin breathes deeply]

01:00:25.913 --> 01:00:29.584
Send these flowers to the Jang family.

01:00:29.667 --> 01:00:32.754
Did someone in the family die recently?
[gasps]

01:00:32.837 --> 01:00:34.881
Why are you sending white chrysanthemums?

01:00:36.090 --> 01:00:38.509
Oh. Ah.

01:00:38.593 --> 01:00:40.678
I almost just made a huge mistake.

01:00:40.762 --> 01:00:41.804
[florist] Indeed.

01:00:43.014 --> 01:00:44.265
Everything from here

01:00:45.391 --> 01:00:46.893
to all the way over there.

01:00:46.976 --> 01:00:48.478
Send them all.

01:00:48.561 --> 01:00:51.147
- All these flowers, sir?
- Yes, all of them.

01:00:51.230 --> 01:00:53.066
There must be at least one
she likes in there.

01:00:53.149 --> 01:00:56.235
Goodness. Oh, thanks a lot. Thanks a lot.

01:00:56.319 --> 01:00:58.404
[florist giggles]

01:00:58.905 --> 01:01:01.199
- [Dang-gu] Which ones do you like?
- [Cho-yeon] These ones.

01:01:01.908 --> 01:01:04.035
Why don't I just get you
all the flowers in here?

01:01:04.118 --> 01:01:06.037
[both laugh]

01:01:07.664 --> 01:01:10.583
[playful music playing]

01:01:16.339 --> 01:01:17.382
[gasps]

01:01:21.427 --> 01:01:23.763
[tense stinger plays]

01:01:28.643 --> 01:01:30.687
The future leader of Songrim…

01:01:31.854 --> 01:01:34.232
and the future leader of Jinyowon
are courting each other?

01:01:34.732 --> 01:01:35.817
Why?

01:01:36.484 --> 01:01:39.529
Will you give up your position
in order to join their family?

01:01:39.612 --> 01:01:43.199
Please, uncle. Young Lady Jin and I
are truly in love.

01:01:43.866 --> 01:01:45.910
Until recently, Young Lady Jin…

01:01:46.828 --> 01:01:48.287
was in love with Uk.

01:01:48.371 --> 01:01:50.957
[sighs] That's wrong.
She proved it to me today.

01:01:51.040 --> 01:01:53.918
Young Lady Jin said that she'd be willing
to give up being leader

01:01:54.001 --> 01:01:55.002
of Jinyowon for love.

01:01:55.086 --> 01:01:56.587
They have one daughter.

01:01:56.671 --> 01:01:58.214
Who would lead Jinyowon then?

01:01:58.798 --> 01:02:01.259
Is the position not supposed to go
to the eldest daughter?

01:02:01.342 --> 01:02:02.719
They'd been getting help.

01:02:02.802 --> 01:02:04.804
Even Cheonbugwan's been helping
to find her sister.

01:02:06.222 --> 01:02:07.140
What?

01:02:07.223 --> 01:02:09.934
The Assistant Gwanju Jin Mu
visits them every day.

01:02:11.644 --> 01:02:13.312
Jin Mu?

01:02:13.396 --> 01:02:15.732
[Dang-gu breathes shakily]
You know,

01:02:15.815 --> 01:02:19.444
I also wish I had a sibling
who could lead Songrim instead.

01:02:20.987 --> 01:02:23.030
So, I'm asking just in case.

01:02:24.115 --> 01:02:25.366
But uncle, please,

01:02:25.450 --> 01:02:27.994
is there any chance that you might have
a secret child hidden somewhere?

01:02:28.077 --> 01:02:30.663
[playful music playing]

01:02:31.914 --> 01:02:32.832
Anyone?

01:02:34.459 --> 01:02:35.626
Just one?

01:02:38.171 --> 01:02:39.005
Get out.

01:02:41.257 --> 01:02:42.091
I said, get out.

01:02:42.175 --> 01:02:43.301
What?

01:02:43.384 --> 01:02:44.469
- Get out!
- [yelps]

01:02:46.554 --> 01:02:48.431
Oh, okay, but it's not too late
to have one.

01:02:48.514 --> 01:02:50.308
- [Jin] What? Hey!
- [Dang-gu] Uh.

01:02:50.391 --> 01:02:52.226
I mean, while you're still healthy.

01:02:54.145 --> 01:02:56.230
Catch that bastard. Catch.

01:02:56.814 --> 01:02:58.024
[sighs]

01:02:58.608 --> 01:02:59.692
[groans]

01:03:00.651 --> 01:03:01.694
Damn you.

01:03:12.830 --> 01:03:15.166
Why do you have so many flowers in here?

01:03:15.833 --> 01:03:19.170
I tried to cut ties with someone.
Now he wants forgiveness.

01:03:19.253 --> 01:03:20.630
[Yun-ok] Mm.

01:03:20.713 --> 01:03:24.258
You should forgive him.
The flowers are so pretty.

01:03:24.926 --> 01:03:26.010
Ah.

01:03:26.677 --> 01:03:28.554
You really have a way with words,
Lady Heo.

01:03:28.638 --> 01:03:29.764
- [maid Kim chuckles]
- [Yun-ok] Hmm.

01:03:29.847 --> 01:03:31.724
Young Master Jang's mother

01:03:32.308 --> 01:03:35.186
was like that. She was also very kind.

01:03:35.269 --> 01:03:38.731
- Young Master Jang is very kind too.
- [chokes]

01:03:39.315 --> 01:03:40.316
Is he really?

01:03:40.399 --> 01:03:41.609
[Yun-ok] Hmm.

01:03:41.692 --> 01:03:45.071
But when could you have possibly witness
our Young Master Jang's kindness?

01:03:45.696 --> 01:03:46.697
Oh.

01:03:47.365 --> 01:03:49.367
When he talked about his mother,

01:03:49.450 --> 01:03:51.202
I could really see the warmth…

01:03:52.245 --> 01:03:53.454
inside his eyes.

01:03:54.205 --> 01:03:55.665
[gasps] He…

01:03:56.415 --> 01:03:59.418
You're telling me
he spoke to you about his mother?

01:03:59.502 --> 01:04:00.628
- [Yun-ok] Hmm.
- [maid Kim gasps]

01:04:00.711 --> 01:04:02.547
In that case,
you two must be extremely close.

01:04:02.630 --> 01:04:03.798
Ah.
[chuckles]

01:04:03.881 --> 01:04:05.633
No, I don't think we really are just yet.

01:04:05.716 --> 01:04:07.718
He's the one who's trying to get closer
to my lady.

01:04:07.802 --> 01:04:11.180
Last time too, he kept her occupied
for more than two whole hours.

01:04:11.722 --> 01:04:13.224
[gasps]
He really did that?

01:04:13.307 --> 01:04:16.227
Uh, we were really just catching up.

01:04:16.310 --> 01:04:18.062
[chuckles, gasps]

01:04:18.688 --> 01:04:21.440
So it really is you. The white heron.

01:04:21.524 --> 01:04:22.733
Ah.

01:04:22.817 --> 01:04:26.612
Young Master Jang can be blunt
'cause he's been hurt so often.

01:04:26.696 --> 01:04:29.574
But after he opens up to you,
he's really very warm and kind.

01:04:30.157 --> 01:04:31.450
- [Yun-ok] Hmm.
- [maid Kim] Oh.

01:04:31.534 --> 01:04:33.452
Please visit often. Hmm?

01:04:33.536 --> 01:04:35.788
I want you to think of this as your home.

01:04:35.872 --> 01:04:38.291
You could fly over and visit all the time.

01:04:38.374 --> 01:04:39.542
[chuckles]

01:04:39.625 --> 01:04:40.668
I will.

01:04:40.751 --> 01:04:42.003
[maid Kim sighs relievedly]

01:04:44.297 --> 01:04:45.756
Hmm.

01:04:47.383 --> 01:04:49.176
[Master Lee]
Jin Mu is helping Jin Ho-gyeong

01:04:49.260 --> 01:04:50.887
to find her missing daughter?

01:04:50.970 --> 01:04:55.141
I think he's using it as an excuse
to visit Jinyowon frequently.

01:04:55.933 --> 01:04:59.812
It sounds like Jin Mu was trying his best
to win Jinyowon over to his side.

01:05:01.105 --> 01:05:03.649
If Jin Mu gets his hands on Jinyowon,

01:05:04.442 --> 01:05:08.070
together they will become powerful enough
to rival Songrim.

01:05:10.281 --> 01:05:12.658
And if they are no longer afraid
of Songrim,

01:05:14.660 --> 01:05:18.205
then I am sure they will reveal
the ice stone they hold.

01:05:26.047 --> 01:05:27.506
[Master Lee] There's more.

01:05:27.590 --> 01:05:30.676
Someone on Jin Mu's side
must have the ice stone.

01:05:32.011 --> 01:05:34.513
The ice stone
may look like a chunk of ice,

01:05:35.765 --> 01:05:40.394
but it also has the nature of fire,
water, and wind.

01:05:41.312 --> 01:05:43.522
Just like the Choi mage 200 years ago,

01:05:44.231 --> 01:05:48.402
someone is using that power
to produce the Soul Ejector.

01:05:59.789 --> 01:06:03.501
[man] The new batch of Soul Ejectors
made by the Queen.

01:06:08.673 --> 01:06:11.425
[Master Lee] It's not the power
of the ice stone that's evil.

01:06:12.051 --> 01:06:15.638
It's the Soul Ejector made from it
that is used for evil deeds.

01:06:18.933 --> 01:06:20.851
A power not granted to humans

01:06:20.935 --> 01:06:24.438
but coveted by anyone
who could get their hands on it.

01:06:25.648 --> 01:06:28.359
The power to leave the body
you no longer wish to live in

01:06:28.442 --> 01:06:30.027
and move to a new one.

01:06:31.779 --> 01:06:36.075
From an old body to a young one.
From an ugly body to a beautiful one.

01:06:37.368 --> 01:06:41.038
The power to stop death
and live for eternity.

01:06:49.046 --> 01:06:50.089
Ah.

01:06:56.721 --> 01:06:59.890
What a young, healthy man.
Exactly what we're looking for.

01:07:00.474 --> 01:07:05.646
He has already been appointed
to become my successor.

01:07:06.439 --> 01:07:08.566
Please move me into this one.

01:07:09.859 --> 01:07:11.277
Uh, master.

01:07:12.278 --> 01:07:14.655
What is the new spell
that you promised to show me?

01:07:15.239 --> 01:07:16.574
The alchemy of souls.

01:07:17.158 --> 01:07:18.409
Alchemy of…

01:07:20.077 --> 01:07:25.374
You see, I still have so much more
that I need to achieve.

01:07:25.458 --> 01:07:29.378
But this body is old and sick
and nearing death.

01:07:30.463 --> 01:07:31.547
Which is…

01:07:32.965 --> 01:07:35.217
why I need your body.

01:07:35.301 --> 01:07:37.803
[foreboding music playing]

01:07:39.555 --> 01:07:40.723
[young mage] What?

01:07:43.768 --> 01:07:46.437
[foreboding music continues playing]

01:07:57.990 --> 01:08:01.202
Now begin… the alchemy of souls.

01:08:09.210 --> 01:08:11.253
Master, I don't wanna switch with you.

01:08:11.837 --> 01:08:14.256
If I enter your body,
then I'm gonna die soon, right?

01:08:14.340 --> 01:08:16.300
But your body will still be alive.

01:08:19.386 --> 01:08:21.388
[young mage grunting]

01:08:22.681 --> 01:08:24.767
[grumbling]

01:08:27.394 --> 01:08:28.521
[young mage] Please help me.

01:08:29.146 --> 01:08:30.439
Someone, please save me.

01:08:31.232 --> 01:08:34.151
Someone help me! Please! Anyone.

01:08:34.235 --> 01:08:36.529
[young mage whimpering]

01:08:36.612 --> 01:08:38.322
Master. Master.

01:08:38.906 --> 01:08:39.949
[gasps]

01:08:41.075 --> 01:08:43.869
[ominous music playing]

01:08:49.083 --> 01:08:50.459
[young mage whimpers]

01:09:16.068 --> 01:09:17.194
[grunts]

01:09:47.141 --> 01:09:49.059
[gasps]

01:09:52.479 --> 01:09:54.315
[coughs]

01:10:01.655 --> 01:10:03.157
[exclaims]

01:10:09.038 --> 01:10:11.415
[snickers]

01:10:14.585 --> 01:10:17.671
- [gasps]
- [cackling]

01:10:24.094 --> 01:10:25.137
[gasps]

01:10:25.846 --> 01:10:27.014
Master…

01:10:28.015 --> 01:10:29.016
my body.

01:10:29.099 --> 01:10:30.935
Give it back to me.

01:10:31.518 --> 01:10:33.729
Please save me. I don't want to die.

01:10:33.812 --> 01:10:36.315
Master. Give me back my body.

01:10:36.398 --> 01:10:39.109
Master! I want my body back!

01:10:39.193 --> 01:10:40.861
[young mage] Master!

01:10:42.238 --> 01:10:45.199
Once again, we have used
the alchemy of souls

01:10:45.282 --> 01:10:46.992
to keep us from losing the soul

01:10:47.701 --> 01:10:48.911
of a great mage.

01:10:50.537 --> 01:10:52.373
[ominous music playing]

01:10:59.004 --> 01:10:59.922
As long as

01:11:00.923 --> 01:11:02.758
we possess the power of the ice stone,

01:11:02.841 --> 01:11:06.679
our souls can live forever
instead of dying in these bodies.

01:11:07.346 --> 01:11:11.267
The great power of the ice stone
is classified as sorcery,

01:11:11.350 --> 01:11:14.144
which is why we have no choice
but to practice in secret.

01:11:14.228 --> 01:11:18.274
But soon, the day will come to reveal
our mighty strength,

01:11:18.357 --> 01:11:21.777
and our righteous will and build
a more powerful world together.

01:11:23.153 --> 01:11:24.196
When it comes,

01:11:25.531 --> 01:11:27.116
everyone of you here

01:11:27.658 --> 01:11:31.036
will overcome death
and be granted immortality.

01:11:31.537 --> 01:11:34.206
[scattered applause]

01:11:37.209 --> 01:11:39.461
[laughing]

01:11:41.588 --> 01:11:43.007
[men cackling]

01:11:43.090 --> 01:11:44.591
[man] Unto eternity!

01:11:45.342 --> 01:11:47.761
[cackling continues]

01:11:47.845 --> 01:11:50.389
[all applauding]

01:11:54.351 --> 01:11:55.936
[Jin Mu] Did you witness everything?

01:11:58.897 --> 01:11:59.982
Yes.

01:12:00.065 --> 01:12:04.611
Your specific role in this is
to bring a special person here.

01:12:05.988 --> 01:12:09.825
You will win over Jin Ho-gyeong,
and you will become mother and daughter.

01:12:09.908 --> 01:12:12.745
And then you must bring her back to me.

01:12:14.621 --> 01:12:16.290
Can you be entrusted with this?

01:12:19.793 --> 01:12:20.878
Yes.

01:12:20.961 --> 01:12:22.963
[ominous music playing]

01:12:30.888 --> 01:12:32.306
[U-tak] She is suitable indeed.

01:12:33.349 --> 01:12:35.726
[Jin Mu] If we manage
to bring Jin Ho-gyeong here,

01:12:37.019 --> 01:12:41.023
we'll be able to unveil the ice stone
sooner than expected.

01:13:04.630 --> 01:13:07.174
[melancholic music playing]

01:13:31.240 --> 01:13:32.074
[U-tak sighs]

01:13:32.658 --> 01:13:34.284
What are you doing up so late, my love?

01:13:41.083 --> 01:13:42.251
[sighs]

01:13:43.168 --> 01:13:45.462
[foreboding music playing]

01:13:45.546 --> 01:13:46.880
[Jin] Jin Mu's power

01:13:47.548 --> 01:13:50.384
might be much stronger than we think.

01:13:52.469 --> 01:13:57.015
The King's Star must have appeared to deal
with the chaos brought by the ice stone.

01:13:59.476 --> 01:14:02.104
Are you speaking about Uk?

01:14:02.187 --> 01:14:05.941
Master Seo Gyeong, who stopped the chaos
of the ice stone 200 years ago,

01:14:06.024 --> 01:14:08.235
was also born with that star's energy.

01:14:08.318 --> 01:14:10.112
How could you possible compare
Master Seo Gyeong

01:14:10.195 --> 01:14:12.072
to a King's Star created through sorcery?

01:14:13.365 --> 01:14:16.201
They're different.
I didn't say they weren't.

01:14:18.162 --> 01:14:19.705
And that is why I'm curious.

01:14:20.539 --> 01:14:22.708
[breathes deeply]

01:14:22.791 --> 01:14:26.920
Will this new star
quietly fade away like this?

01:14:28.297 --> 01:14:29.882
Or will he start to shine?

01:14:32.092 --> 01:14:35.637
[thrilling music playing]

01:14:48.275 --> 01:14:49.401
[grunts]

01:15:03.040 --> 01:15:04.500
[sighs]

01:15:08.086 --> 01:15:09.129
[referee] The winner.

01:15:09.213 --> 01:15:11.673
- [mage 1] Wow, you were amazing.
- [mage 2] I knew you're gonna win.

01:15:11.757 --> 01:15:12.841
He's nothing.

01:15:12.925 --> 01:15:15.177
[thrilling music continues playing]

01:15:17.387 --> 01:15:18.597
[grunts]

01:15:18.680 --> 01:15:19.598
- [mage screams]
- [Jang Uk grunts]

01:15:21.266 --> 01:15:23.685
[both grunting]

01:15:36.114 --> 01:15:37.199
[pants]

01:15:38.075 --> 01:15:39.284
[sighs]

01:15:43.038 --> 01:15:45.249
- [Jang Uk grunts]
- [epic music playing]

01:15:47.084 --> 01:15:48.085
[Jang Uk grunts]

01:15:48.669 --> 01:15:49.503
[sword clinks]

01:15:50.629 --> 01:15:52.297
[sword rasps]

01:15:55.759 --> 01:15:57.386
I already know you use Tansu.

01:15:58.136 --> 01:16:00.222
[mage] The Crown Prince didn't,
which is why it worked with him.

01:16:00.305 --> 01:16:03.225
But the Tansu you did just now
with the water was obvious.

01:16:03.308 --> 01:16:04.518
And it wasn't hard to block.

01:16:04.601 --> 01:16:07.145
[tense music playing]

01:16:08.230 --> 01:16:09.314
[screams]

01:16:09.398 --> 01:16:10.899
[grunting]

01:16:13.026 --> 01:16:14.444
[groans]

01:16:16.572 --> 01:16:18.073
[pants]

01:16:18.699 --> 01:16:19.950
[referee] The winner.

01:16:20.033 --> 01:16:21.702
[mages cheer]

01:16:21.785 --> 01:16:24.621
- [indistinct chatter]
- [sighs]

01:16:25.330 --> 01:16:28.458
[thrilling music playing]

01:16:44.057 --> 01:16:46.268
[Go Won] There are only
three gold toads remaining?

01:16:46.351 --> 01:16:47.603
[eunuch] Yes, sire.

01:16:48.562 --> 01:16:51.690
So that means he's been fighting
every day for the past seven days?

01:16:51.773 --> 01:16:53.859
It also means he's been losing every day.

01:16:55.360 --> 01:16:58.196
I assumed he would stop fighting
after he lost a few times.

01:17:01.074 --> 01:17:03.076
[Go Won] But it seems he'll fight
to the end for this.

01:17:03.160 --> 01:17:06.705
You were right, Your Highness.
His swordsmanship and spells are weak.

01:17:06.788 --> 01:17:08.206
But because he's stubborn,

01:17:08.290 --> 01:17:10.751
he'll just keep fighting
like his life depends on it.

01:17:10.834 --> 01:17:14.963
Even though it's just sparring, he's been
fighting Jeongjingak mages every day.

01:17:15.047 --> 01:17:16.590
He must be exhausted.

01:17:16.673 --> 01:17:19.676
I'm certain you'll win the bet,
Your Highness.

01:17:19.760 --> 01:17:22.721
Even I never had the opportunity
to spar with the Jeongjingak mages.

01:17:22.804 --> 01:17:25.932
But I'm letting him do it ten times more
than I ever done

01:17:26.016 --> 01:17:27.601
at the expense of my toads.

01:17:27.684 --> 01:17:29.686
Did I get fooled by that Filthy Mu-deok?

01:17:30.771 --> 01:17:32.856
[foreboding music playing]

01:17:41.907 --> 01:17:43.700
[grunting]

01:17:49.873 --> 01:17:52.793
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk,
fight until you're broken.

01:17:52.876 --> 01:17:55.754
[tense music playing]

01:18:07.307 --> 01:18:10.227
Every single agony
that does not kill you…

01:18:11.645 --> 01:18:12.938
[Jang Uk pants]

01:18:15.190 --> 01:18:18.151
…will make you stronger in the end.

01:18:18.777 --> 01:18:21.488
[intense music playing]

01:18:27.577 --> 01:18:30.997
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the garden playing]

01:18:51.560 --> 01:18:53.770
- Jang Uk.
- You must be here for your young master.

01:18:53.854 --> 01:18:56.106
[Seo Yul] Uk may be losing,
but he's still improving.

01:18:57.691 --> 01:18:58.525
[Mu-deok] Don't go.

01:18:58.608 --> 01:19:00.402
Don't go to your room and stay here.

01:19:00.485 --> 01:19:02.362
Gosh. Your shoes are all wet, too.

01:19:03.155 --> 01:19:04.406
You are hurt.

01:19:05.824 --> 01:19:07.325
The capital is in an uproar right now.

01:19:07.409 --> 01:19:10.495
[Dang-gu] But rumor has it that he was
attacked by assassins last night.

01:19:10.579 --> 01:19:11.955
- [Jin] Do not kill him.
- Kill him.

01:19:13.790 --> 01:19:15.876
- He's a soul shifter.
- Come out.

01:19:15.959 --> 01:19:17.586
- [Jang Uk] I'm coming out.
- [Jin Mu] Jang Uk.

01:19:17.669 --> 01:19:21.965
I don't think it's right to let a mage
who barged in here leave so easily.

01:19:22.048 --> 01:19:24.134
[Seo Yul] But once they run wild,
there is no turning back.

01:19:24.217 --> 01:19:26.219
They are no longer human but a monster.

01:19:26.303 --> 01:19:29.055
We can also choose to protect
the monsters from this world.
